web-server.js — HTTP API + static file serving for mcp-agent-portal

startWebServer(projectRoot)→{server,proxyManager,networkAccess}|boot HTTP server, spawn MCP children, register gateway
serveStaticFile(reqPath,res)→void|serve static files from web/ or packages/ dirs

ROUTES:
  POST /api/mcp-call|proxy MCP tool call to child server
  GET /api/instances|list all registered MCP servers
  GET /api/project-info|portal metadata (name,path,agents,pid)
  GET /api/runtime|runtime status plus sanitized Symbiote dev-plane manifest and MCP source summary
  GET /api/runtime/health|compact runtime health counts
  GET /api/server-status|uptime,agents,monitors
  GET /api/network-auth/pending|local-only list of LAN browser approvals
  POST /api/network-auth/approve|local-only approve LAN browser session
  POST /api/network-auth/reject|local-only reject LAN browser session
  GET /api/network-auth/wait|LAN browser pending approval poll
  POST /api/stop|graceful shutdown exit(0)
  POST /api/restart|config-change restart exit(2)
  GET /api/*|fallback HTTP proxy to local-gateway backends

PATTERNS: fail-fast config|exit(2) restart|raw http.createServer|no framework
ENV:
  AGENT_PORTAL_PORT|optional fixed port used by restart to preserve the current direct UI URL
  AGENT_PORTAL_NETWORK_AUTH|set 0 only behind a trusted gateway that owns access policy
  SYMBIOTE_DEV_PLANE_ROOT|optional local root for manifest-level dev-plane diagnostics
DEPS: local-gateway.js|mcp-proxy.js|network-access.js|network-auth.js
